↓
Rule-Based Quality Validation
↓
Structured Recommendation Output
↓
Recommendation Display Channel

Part 1 should use Azure OpenAI or an approved enterprise LLM to extract structured information from unstructured change text. However, the quality decision should be based on deterministic validation rules.

Example extraction fields:

{
"change_number": "CHG90001",
"environment": "Production",
"change_type": "storage_networking_change",
"affected_service": "Azure Storage",
"resource_names": ["stgprodcritical01"],
