25. Risk Flags

ARCA should support structured risk flags.

Examples:

ROLE_OVERPRIVILEGED
Requested role is broader than required.

SCOPE_TOO_BROAD
Requested scope is broader than the affected resource or resource group.

DURATION_TOO_LONG
Requested duration exceeds approved change window.

IMPLEMENTER_MISMATCH
PIM requester does not match approved implementer.

CHANGE_NUMBER_MISSING
PIM justification does not mention valid change number.

RESOURCE_MISMATCH
PIM scope does not match resource mentioned in change.

CHANGE_DETAILS_INSUFFICIENT
Change does not contain enough information for access review.

EMERGENCY_HIGH_RISK
Emergency change requests broad privileged access.

MANUAL_REVIEW_REQUIRED
ARCA cannot make a confident recommendation.

